  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Two data streams",
      "items": [
        "Record: demographics, diagnoses, labs, and a simulated TCF7L2 allele count written as FHIR",
        "Wearables: CGM, heart rate, sleep stages and steps in an Apple Health-style file",
        "Per-stream consent gate in the dashboard: withdrawing the record drops the record prior and medicine list but keeps the personal CGM fit; withdrawing wearables drops sleep, HRV and walks; both widen the band, and alerts, plans and ranking follow"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Twin loop that is actually on screen",
      "items": [
        "The live twin shrinks the personal fit toward a record + cluster prior; each is kept only when it clearly beats the group prior on validation days",
        "The chart calls forecastCurve with sleep, HRV and walk adjustments. The Kalman engine does not replace those knobs",
        "Spike risk adds the habitual next meal, so warnings can come up to 2 hours ahead",
        "What-if ranks meals, walks and seven lifestyle plans, including a weekly fasting day. No dosing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Trust and safety",
      "items": [
        "Only Urgent alerts interrupt; a Watch is upgraded in place when the curve worsens. Each alert has reasons",
        "Hazards, change bounds and intended use are in docs/HAZARDS.md and docs/REGULATORY.md",
        "One-click pre-visit clinical summary prints the twin, 7-day time in range, the chosen plan and urgent alerts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Not in this build",
      "items": [
        "No ABDM-certified import or export, and Synthea was not run",
        "No Web Worker on-device mode; the dashboard loads a committed snapshot of the fitted ward; reports/scale.json is a one-thread compute benchmark",
        "LightGBM is an offline CGMacros comparison, not a live residual",
        "Validated numbers are the stored CGMacros table plus the stress-test generator"
      ]
    }
  ]
